{"text": "After the city reassessed our apartment, the arnona jumped by almost thirty percent, so we're appealing it.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 45, "end": 51, "surface": "arnona", "term": "arnona"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Arnona again? I thought we just dealt with that.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 6, "surface": "Arnona", "term": "arnona"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "How long is the train ride from Tel Aviv to ashdod these days?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Are you coming to our barbecue for yom haatzmaut this year?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 35, "end": 48, "surface": "yom haatzmaut", "term": "yom haatzmaut"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Have you ever been to tel aviv?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "So, gan? He's been going since he was two.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 4, "end": 7, "surface": "gan", "term": "gan"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "tel aviv? Too hot this time of year.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Nobody warned me that misrad haklita would ask for the same documents three separate times.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 22, "end": 36, "surface": "misrad haklita", "term": "misrad haklita"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Aliyah? Not for me, I'm happy where I am.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 6, "surface": "Aliyah", "term": "aliyah"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Is aba coming to the party?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 3, "end": 6, "surface": "aba", "term": "aba"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "The gan teacher called to say he fell and scraped his knee, but he's okay.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 4, "end": 7, "surface": "gan", "term": "gan"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Where is misrad haklita again — the building near the central bus station?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 9, "end": 23, "surface": "misrad haklita", "term": "misrad haklita"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We're thinking of moving to tel aviv, but the rent is insane.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 28, "end": 36, "surface": "tel aviv", "term": "tel aviv"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Ugh, pesach.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 5, "end": 11, "surface": "pesach", "term": "pesach"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "yom haatzmaut again — same flags, same playlist.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 13, "surface": "yom haatzmaut", "term": "yom haatzmaut"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Two hours at misrad haklita and all I walked out with was a form to fill in at home.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 13, "end": 27, "surface": "misrad haklita", "term": "misrad haklita"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I called aba three times but he didn't pick up.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 9, "end": 12, "surface": "aba", "term": "aba"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "ashdod? Yeah, I was down there for a job interview last month.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 6, "surface": "ashdod", "term": "ashdod"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Are you going home for the chag, or staying in Tel Aviv this time?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 27, "end": 31, "surface": "chag", "term": "chag"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I've been avoiding leavened bread for weeks already, and pesach hasn't even started.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 57, "end": 63, "surface": "pesach", "term": "pesach"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We spent yom haatzmaut on the beach in Tel Aviv, watching the flyover and eating way too much grilled meat.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 9, "end": 22, "surface": "yom haatzmaut", "term": "yom haatzmaut"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I used to take the bus to rishon lezion every morning for work.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 26, "end": 39, "surface": "rishon lezion", "term": "rishon lezion"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "aba, seriously?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "surface": "aba", "term": "aba"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "After years of delays, they finally completed their aliyah and moved to Tel Aviv.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 52, "end": 58, "surface": "aliyah", "term": "aliyah"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "If they ever finish the light rail, getting to ashdod from the center will be a completely different story.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 47, "end": 53, "surface": "ashdod", "term": "ashdod"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you know if there's a good hummus place in rishon lezion?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 46, "end": 59, "surface": "rishon lezion", "term": "rishon lezion"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you already pay the arnona for this quarter, or is it still sitting on the counter?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 24, "end": 30, "surface": "arnona", "term": "arnona"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Big chag at my parents' this year.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 4, "end": 8, "surface": "chag", "term": "chag"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "What's the biggest challenge you faced during your aliyah?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 51, "end": 57, "surface": "aliyah", "term": "aliyah"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We always cook way too much food for the chag, and then we spend the next week eating leftovers.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 41, "end": 45, "surface": "chag", "term": "chag"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "What time does gan start in the morning?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 15, "end": 18, "surface": "gan", "term": "gan"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Are you coming to our pesach seder this year?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 22, "end": 34, "surface": "pesach seder", "term": "pesach seder"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "So, chool? Never heard of it.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "rishon lezion—my aunt's been living there for ages.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 13, "surface": "rishon lezion", "term": "rishon lezion"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Why do you keep bringing up chool when you know it upsets her?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We spent the entire afternoon arguing about chool and its implications.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 44, "end": 49, "surface": "chool", "term": "chool"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "My grandma still calls me her baby, even though I'm thirty.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "She told me the entire story bekeitzur, but I still didn't get the point.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 29, "end": 38, "surface": "bekeitzur", "term": "bekeitzur"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I had a tzilum of my knee, but the doctor said it's just a sprain.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 8, "end": 14, "surface": "tzilum", "term": "tzilum"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I grabbed a pita and stuffed it with chicken and salad for lunch.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 12, "end": 16, "surface": "pita", "term": "pita"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Ugh, tofes 1329.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 5, "end": 10, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you hear about the kizuz at the university?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 23, "end": 28, "surface": "kizuz", "term": "kizuz"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Are you going to call me bekarov?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 25, "end": 32, "surface": "bekarov", "term": "bekarov"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you want a hafuch or just water?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 14, "end": 20, "surface": "hafuch", "term": "hafuch"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you preheat the tanur before putting the kugel in?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 20, "end": 25, "surface": "tanur", "term": "tanur"}, {"start": 45, "end": 50, "surface": "kugel", "term": "kugel"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you want your sandwich on pita or regular bread?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Yeah, bekarov.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 6, "end": 13, "surface": "bekarov", "term": "bekarov"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "The clerk told me I needed tofes 1329, but when I asked where to find it, she just shrugged and pointed at the photocopier.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 27, "end": 32, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Does your bituach siud cover consultations with a dietitian, or only the basic stuff?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 10, "end": 22, "surface": "bituach siud", "term": "bituach siud"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "One hafuch, please.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 4, "end": 10, "surface": "hafuch", "term": "hafuch"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "The tanur's on the fritz again.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 4, "end": 9, "surface": "tanur", "term": "tanur"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I spent all morning scrubbing the tanur because the challah overflowed and burned.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 34, "end": 39, "surface": "tanur", "term": "tanur"}, {"start": 52, "end": 59, "surface": "challah", "term": "challah"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "When is your tzilum scheduled?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 13, "end": 19, "surface": "tzilum", "term": "tzilum"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "No tofes 1335, no service.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 3, "end": 8, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "She toasted the pita until it was crispy and then dipped it in olive oil.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 16, "end": 20, "surface": "pita", "term": "pita"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I thought I'd finish it bekarov, but I keep putting it off.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": [": "]}
{"text": "Did you already fill out tofes 1335 for the tax rebate?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 25, "end": 30, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "First the tzilum, then we'll know if it's serious.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 10, "end": 16, "surface": "tzilum", "term": "tzilum"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "mas hachnasa ov, again? I thought I was done with that.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 15, "surface": "mas hachnasa ov", "term": "mas hachnasa ov"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Have you ever tried to get a tofes 1329 stamped after 2 PM on a Friday?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 29, "end": 34, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I was stuck at the ministry for hours because I couldn't find tofes 1335 anywhere.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 62, "end": 67, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "The pita fell apart as soon as I tried to open the pocket.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I spent all morning at the misrad hapnim trying to sort out my mas hachnasa ov.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 27, "end": 40, "surface": "misrad hapnim", "term": "misrad hapnim"}, {"start": 63, "end": 78, "surface": "mas hachnasa ov", "term": "mas hachnasa ov"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you say lechayim before or after the first sip?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 11, "end": 19, "surface": "lechayim", "term": "lechayim"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Lechayim, everyone!", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 8, "surface": "Lechayim", "term": "lechayim"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I finally signed up for bituach siud through my health fund, and it's already paying off.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 24, "end": 36, "surface": "bituach siud", "term": "bituach siud"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "No bituach siud, no fancy meal plan.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 3, "end": 15, "surface": "bituach siud", "term": "bituach siud"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Have you ever tried a frozen krembo?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 29, "end": 35, "surface": "krembo", "term": "krembo"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "How do you observe aveilut during the first week?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 19, "end": 26, "surface": "aveilut", "term": "aveilut"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "shufersal? Yeah, that's where I do most of my shopping.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "surface": "shufersal", "term": "shufersal"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We ordered a plate of pita and olives to share at the table.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Aveilut, huh?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 7, "surface": "Aveilut", "term": "aveilut"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "He always brings pita chips to the party, and everyone loves them.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you already send the tofes 1331 to the accountant, or are we still waiting on the bank statements?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 25, "end": 30, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "At the dinner table, my grandfather would always stand up, raise his glass, and boom lechayim in that deep voice of his.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 85, "end": 93, "surface": "lechayim", "term": "lechayim"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Straight from the freezer, krembo.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 27, "end": 33, "surface": "krembo", "term": "krembo"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We were in aveilut for my grandmother, so I learned all the prayers.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 11, "end": 18, "surface": "aveilut", "term": "aveilut"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "They scheduled a tzilum raentgen for tomorrow morning to see if anything's broken.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 17, "end": 23, "surface": "tzilum", "term": "tzilum"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "krembo always ends up in my shopping cart.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 6, "surface": "krembo", "term": "krembo"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Just the tofes 1331 — nothing else.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 9, "end": 14, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do we need ktzitzot for the grill?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 11, "end": 19, "surface": "ktzitzot", "term": "ktzitzot"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I've never made pita from scratch, but I hear it's not that hard.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Another kizuz. Great.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 8, "end": 13, "surface": "kizuz", "term": "kizuz"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did the orthopedist order a tzilum raentgen before you left the clinic?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 28, "end": 43, "surface": "tzilum raentgen", "term": "tzilum raentgen"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We spent a weekend at a charming chateau in the countryside.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "tofes 1368, again — third time this year, and nobody there can tell me why.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Are you going to fast on taanit esther this year, or skip it because it's on a Friday?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 25, "end": 38, "surface": "taanit esther", "term": "taanit esther"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Can you pass me a clean tzalachat from the top shelf?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 24, "end": 33, "surface": "tzalachat", "term": "tzalachat"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Ktzitzot, obviously.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 8, "surface": "Ktzitzot", "term": "ktzitzot"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I spent the whole morning on the phone with the tax office because they claimed my tofes 1331 was missing a signature, even though I filed it back in April.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 83, "end": 88, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Where do I even download tofes 1368 — is it still on their site, or do I have to go to the office in person?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 25, "end": 30, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you remember to buy halva for the guests?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 24, "end": 29, "surface": "halva", "term": "halva"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Is there any direct line to shalem from the junction, or do I have to change in town?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 28, "end": 34, "surface": "shalem", "term": "shalem"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "The chateau's stone walls have stood for centuries.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "taanit esther again, huh?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 13, "surface": "taanit esther", "term": "taanit esther"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "My accountant said she'd take care of tofes 1368 for me, but I still got a reminder in the mail, so who knows.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 38, "end": 43, "surface": "tofes", "term": "tofes"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Just stack the tzalachat over there when you're done.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 15, "end": 24, "surface": "tzalachat", "term": "tzalachat"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Halva with extra pistachios, please.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "surface": "Halva", "term": "halva"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Last year I broke my fast too early after taanit esther and felt guilty for days.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 42, "end": 55, "surface": "taanit esther", "term": "taanit esther"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "If I win the lottery, I'll buy a chateau in southern France.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I got a great deal on ktzitzot at the shuk.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 22, "end": 30, "surface": "ktzitzot", "term": "ktzitzot"}, {"start": 38, "end": 42, "surface": "shuk", "term": "shuk"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you remember to renew the bituach bayit before the storm hits?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 30, "end": 43, "surface": "bituach bayit", "term": "bituach bayit"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you think it's weird to wish someone tzom kal if they're not fasting?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 40, "end": 48, "surface": "tzom kal", "term": "tzom kal"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Yeah, bituach bayit? I sorted that out last week.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 6, "end": 19, "surface": "bituach bayit", "term": "bituach bayit"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I found a chipped tzalachat at the back of the cupboard this morning.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 18, "end": 27, "surface": "tzalachat", "term": "tzalachat"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Bo, are you seriously telling me you forgot the keys again?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "surface": "Bo", "term": "bo"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "I finally sat down to deal with my mas hachnasa ashrai, and now I need a drink.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 35, "end": 54, "surface": "mas hachnasa ashrai", "term": "mas hachnasa ashrai"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "She gave a tour of the chateau to her visiting relatives.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "No chanaya anywhere.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 3, "end": 10, "surface": "chanaya", "term": "chanaya"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Bo, we've been through this a hundred times already.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "surface": "Bo", "term": "bo"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Is there any shapira left in the fridge, or did you finish it again?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 13, "end": 20, "surface": "shapira", "term": "shapira"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Where did you say the chanaya is?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 22, "end": 29, "surface": "chanaya", "term": "chanaya"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Tzom kal, you too.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 8, "surface": "Tzom kal", "term": "tzom kal"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "When we bought the apartment, the lawyer insisted we get bituach bayit before signing anything.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 57, "end": 70, "surface": "bituach bayit", "term": "bituach bayit"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We sat on the porch until midnight, nursing a shapira and arguing about nothing in particular.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 46, "end": 53, "surface": "shapira", "term": "shapira"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you remember to submit the mas hachnasa ashrai form before the deadline?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 31, "end": 50, "surface": "mas hachnasa ashrai", "term": "mas hachnasa ashrai"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "That chateau looks like something out of a fairy tale.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you think it's okay to bring food when you go for nichum aveilim?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 53, "end": 67, "surface": "nichum aveilim", "term": "nichum aveilim"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "My doctor wrote a horaat keva for physical therapy, so I can go twice a week without new referrals.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 18, "end": 29, "surface": "horaat keva", "term": "horaat keva"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you know if the mikve is open on Saturday night?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 19, "end": 24, "surface": "mikve", "term": "mikve"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Just a meorav yerushalmi for me, thanks.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 7, "end": 24, "surface": "meorav yerushalmi", "term": "meorav yerushalmi"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "The chateau was once home to a wealthy merchant family.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "The 4:40 bus out of shalem is always packed with soldiers heading home for the weekend.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 20, "end": 26, "surface": "shalem", "term": "shalem"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Just drop me at shalem — it's a ten-minute walk from there anyway.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 16, "end": 22, "surface": "shalem", "term": "shalem"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Bo. That's all I'm saying.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "surface": "Bo", "term": "bo"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did you call savta before we left?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 13, "end": 18, "surface": "savta", "term": "savta"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Nichum aveilim? I always feel like I say the wrong thing.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 14, "surface": "Nichum aveilim", "term": "nichum aveilim"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "We circled the chanaya for twenty minutes before giving up.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 15, "end": 22, "surface": "chanaya", "term": "chanaya"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Did your horaat keva cover the new medication, or did you have to pay extra?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 9, "end": 20, "surface": "horaat keva", "term": "horaat keva"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "beit knesset at seven?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 0, "end": 12, "surface": "beit knesset", "term": "beit knesset"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Where can I find good meorav yerushalmi around here?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 22, "end": 39, "surface": "meorav yerushalmi", "term": "meorav yerushalmi"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "Do you know how to get to the chateau from here?", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "He ordered meorav yerushalmi and a side of hummus, but then complained it was too greasy.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [], "unmatched_terms": ["Mearav Yerushalmi"]}
{"text": "Going to the mikve, be back soon.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 13, "end": 18, "surface": "mikve", "term": "mikve"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "My Israeli coworker always says tzom kal to me before Yom Kippur, even though I'm not Jewish.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 32, "end": 40, "surface": "tzom kal", "term": "tzom kal"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
{"text": "After her conversion, she told me the mikve was the most intense part of the whole process.", "annotator": "qwen/qwen3.8-flash", "spans": [{"start": 38, "end": 43, "surface": "mikve", "term": "mikve"}], "unmatched_terms": []}
